            <note corresp="#d193-f3" n="3" xml:id="d193-f3-content">
                <p>Not found in Department of State files.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d193-f4" n="4" xml:id="d193-f4-content">
                <p><ref target="#d192"><hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d193-f5" n="5" xml:id="d193-f5-content">
                <p>A handwritten notation on the source text reads: “Would like to see Weiler if
                    available. C.A.H.” No record of a meeting between Herter and Weiler has been
                    found in Department of State files, but Weiler later confirmed to the editors
                    that he met with Herter upon his return to Washington on this occasion.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
